Terra SDK Build Instructions
============================

Ratman is built only as part of the Terra SDK root CMake project. From the
repository root, use the canonical Docker environment:

    bash scripts/build_docker_image.sh
    bash scripts/build_cmake.sh
    bash scripts/verify_baseline.sh

For a host build with all dependencies installed:

    cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
    cmake --build build --target terra_sdk_cmake_smoke --parallel
    ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure

See docs/BUILD_SYSTEM.md for targets, dependencies, artifact checks, and
focused viewer/nav3d commands.
